### Test Ollama Gemma4 Model

### Check if Ollama is running
GET http://localhost:11434/api/tags

###

### Generate text with Gemma4 - Simple prompt
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:26b",
  "prompt": "What is TypeScript?",
  "stream": false
}

###

### Generate text with Gemma4 - Multi-line prompt
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:26b",
  "prompt": "Explain the difference between var, let, and const in JavaScript",
  "stream": false,
  "temperature": 0.7
}

###

### Generate text with Gemma4 - CodeGeneration
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:26b",
  "prompt": "Write a function to calculate the factorial of a number in TypeScript",
  "stream": false
}

###

### Generate with streaming enabled
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:26b",
  "prompt": "List 5 best practices for REST APIs",
  "stream": true
}

###

### Chat endpoint (if available)
POST http://localhost:11434/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:26b",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What is a CLI application?"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false
}
